{
  "$comment": "Performance budgets (docs/specs/pincel.md §4.5, docs/specs/performance-benchmarks.md). Every value is lower-is-better; `max` is in `unit`. Frame-rate budgets (60 fps) check the p95 frame time against 17 ms (16.7 ms plus vsync jitter of the rAF timestamps), latency budgets the p95 latency. Checked in budget mode only (reference machine).",
  "tolerance": 0.1,
  "budgets": [
    {
      "metric": "browser/image-brush-4k/dab-draw-latency-p95",
      "scenario": "Brush dab, Image 3840x2160, 10 layers, dab latency (pointer event received -> draw call)",
